person.birth:
21 March 1897 (not 1896 as on attestation paper;
              confirmed with Vital Statistics Manitoba Database) near Glenboro in Argyle, Manitoba,
              Canada.

event.p:
Wounded and missing on 13 June 1916 (presumed dead), several days after departure
                from England. He was later declared for official purposes to have died that on day,
                but his body was never recovered.
